Subject: [PATCH 1/4] add score package: in-search driver quad registries +
 types

New AI-module classes for the make-magic in-search quad Driver seam:
  DriverBonus (Phi reward-shaping registry), ComboMacro + MacroRegistry
  (P/macro), SelectionSteer + SelectionRegistry (S selection steer).
All keyed by the stable playerId UUID; strict no-op for unregistered seats.
